(Photosynthesis - Study Notes) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Photosynthesis is the process by which green plants, algae and some) Tj
T*
(bacteria convert light energy into chemical energy stored as glucose.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The overall equation is:) Tj
T*
(  6 CO2 + 6 H2O + light energy -> C6H12O6 + 6 O2) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(It occurs mainly in the leaves, inside organelles called chloroplasts.) Tj
T*
(Chloroplasts contain the green pigment chlorophyll, which absorbs) Tj
T*
(mostly red and blue light and reflects green light.) Tj
T*
